Shared-memory tiles for a tiled matmul (an A tile and a B tile, both f32):
-- 16x16 tile pair, 2048 bytes --
NVIDIA Hopper, per block      232448 B budget   113 tile(s) of 2048 B
Apple GPU, per threadgroup     32768 B budget    16 tile(s) of 2048 B
-- 32x32 tile pair, 8192 bytes --
NVIDIA Hopper, per block      232448 B budget    28 tile(s) of 8192 B
Apple GPU, per threadgroup     32768 B budget     4 tile(s) of 8192 B
-- 64x64 tile pair, 32768 bytes --
NVIDIA Hopper, per block      232448 B budget     7 tile(s) of 32768 B
Apple GPU, per threadgroup     32768 B budget     1 tile(s) of 32768 B
